<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Confirm Your Email</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0px 0px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        h1 {
            color: #333;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 15px 25px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            background-color: #008CBA;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 16px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #999;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Confirm Your Email</h1>
        <p>Thank you for registering with us </p>
        <p>We're excited to have you join us. Click the button below to confirm your email address and start exploring.</p>
       <!-- ✅ Clickable Button -->
        <a href="{{verificationLink}}" class="btn">Confirm Email Address</a>

        <!-- ✅ Backup Link if Button Fails -->
       
        <p>If you did not sign up for this account, you can ignore this email.</p>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Best Regards,<br>The Team</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>